GAME OVERVIEW & VISION
- Genre & Style: Roguelike deckbuilder RPG with persistent progression across finite themed dungeons. Short, replayable runs emphasize experimentation, sequencing depth, and multi-element hybrid synergies.
- Core Loop:
  1. Enter a themed dungeon (25–35 nodes).
  2. Navigate map → fight enemies → gain rewards (cards, gold, relics).
  3. Use Cascade Meter to chain ramps, pivot elements (Shift/Transmute/Dual), and unleash Finishers.
  4. Die or win → meta progression (deck thins/adds, relics, gold spent in hub).
- Win/Loss Conditions:
  - Run Win: Defeat the final Act 3 boss of the dungeon.
  - Run Loss: Player HP ≤ 0 (permadeath: lose 30% gold + run-only cards; deck/relics persist).
  - Combat Win: All enemies HP ≤ 0.
  - Combat Loss: Player HP ≤ 0 (rare mid-run escape relics possible).
- Player Experience Pillars:
  - Dopamine chaining (ramp → pivot → burst).
  - Joyful experimentation (no decay → bank freely, try hybrids via Duals/Shifts).
  - Tactical tension (spend points now or hold for Finisher? Match for full power or mismatch bailout?).
  - Mastery curve: Early mono safe → late multi-god runs.
- Run Length & Pacing: ~60 min total. Fights: 3–4 min (8–20 turns). No Cascade decay extends viable banking, balanced by enemy drains and point caps.

CORE STATS & RESOURCES
- HP: Player starts 80 (+relic bonuses). No natural regen outside cards/effects.
- Energy: +3 at turn start (meta upgrades to 7 max). Regenerates fully each turn. Spent on cards only.
- Hand: Draw 5 at turn start (max hand size 10). Excess draw discards randomly.
- Draw/Discard/Exhaust Piles: Standard reshuffle when draw empty. Run-only cards exhaust (removed post-run). Keyword "Exhaust": Card removed from deck after play (for the run).
- Block: Temporary HP buffer. Decays fully at end of player turn (unless relic/effect prevents).
- Cascade Meter:
  - Current Element (Fire/Frost/Storm/Stone/Void, or Neutral at 0).
  - Points: 0–7 (visual: 7 pips/orb glow).
  - Starts at 0 Neutral each combat.
  - No end-of-turn decay → bank indefinitely for experimentation.
  - Gain: +1 per Chain (cap 7).
  - Spend: Via Transmute/Shift/Dual/Finisher.
  - Reset: Finisher consumes all → back to 0 Neutral.
- Deck Limits: Non-Legendary cards max 4 copies. Legendary cards max 1 copy per deck.

COMBAT FLOW (STEP-BY-STEP)
1. Combat Start:
   - Player HP full (carryover from prior fights if relic allows).
   - Cascade: 0 Neutral.
   - Draw 5 cards.
   - Gain 3 Energy.
   - Enemy intents preview (next 2 turns visible).
2. Player Turn:
   - Play any number of cards (energy permitting).
   - Sequence matters: Effects resolve immediately (e.g., Draw/Search mid-turn).
   - Target selection: Single enemy default; AoE hits all.
   - Keywords: Exhaust triggers post-play.
3. End Player Turn:
   - Discard remaining hand.
   - Block → 0 (unless prevented).
   - No Cascade decay.
   - Apply player statuses (Regen heals, Poison dmg).
4. Enemy Turn(s):
   - All enemies act (simultaneous if multiple).
   - Resolve intents (damage, buffs, debuffs).
   - Apply enemy statuses.
   - Some enemies: "Cascade Drain X if player ≥L5" or "Echo last player element (apply minor Burn/Chill)".
5. Next Turn: Player draws 5 (or remaining if <5), +3 Energy, repeat.
6. Combat End: Rewards screen (gold, run-relics, heal/upgrade chances, boss packs).

ELEMENTS & SYNERGY WHEEL
5 Elements (pentagon wheel – adjacent = good pairs):
- Fire: Aggro/DoT Ramp – High raw dmg, AoE, Pierce | Weak to control | Burn, Vulnerable
- Frost: Tank/Control – Massive Block/Regen, debuff lock | Slow ramp | Chill, Slow, Frail
- Storm: Cycle/Multi-Hit – Draw/Energy, multi-target shred | Inconsistent | Shock, Overload
- Stone: Debuff/Wall – Permanent debuffs, unbreakable Block | Low direct dmg | Weak, Frail, Crumble
- Void: Sustain/Steal – Steal buffs/intents, Poison/Regen | Ramp delay | Poison, Corrode, Disarm

Good Pairs (wheel amps on Transmute/Shift):
- Fire → Storm: +50% any +2 hits | +1 pt refund
- Frost → Stone: +10 Block + Weak 2 | +1 pt
- Storm → Void: +Draw 2 +1 Energy | +1 pt
- Stone → Fire: Pierce + Burn AoE | +1 pt
- Void → Frost: +Poison 3 + Slow 1 | +1 pt

STATUS EFFECTS – FULL MECHANICS (28 Total)
General Rules:
- Applied immediately on play/hit.
- Stacking: Additive for numbers (Burn 3 = 9 dmg/t + lose Block). Duration refreshes or adds.
- Duration: Turns remaining (player statuses tick at player EOT; enemy at enemy turn end).
- Cap: Most stack to reasonable limits.
- Interactions: Fire cleanses Chill; Void Corrode amplifies Vulnerable; Overload before player dmg; Echo repeats last applied effect.

Offense:
- Vulnerable: +50% dmg taken (additive stacks)
- Weak: -25% dmg dealt (additive stacks)
- Poison: 2 dmg/turn (additive stacks)
- Burn: 3 dmg/turn + lose all current Block this turn (additive dmg, Block loss per tick)
- Chill: -1 Energy at next turn start (stacks reduce more; min 0)
- Corrode: +25% Vulnerable potency per stack (multiplicative with Vuln stacks)
- Crumble: -1 max HP/turn (permanent until combat end; rare)

Defense:
- Block: Absorbs dmg (additive; decays EOT unless prevented)
- Strength: +25% dmg dealt (additive; rare player source)
- Dexterity: +25% Block gained from cards (additive)
- Ward: +50% Block this turn only (instant, non-stacking)

Control:
- Stun: Skip full next turn (non-stacking; overrides Slow)
- Slow: -1 action (play fewer cards or skip minor action; stacks reduce more)
- Disarm: No attack/dmg cards playable next turn (non-stacking)
- Shock: Skip 1 random action/card play (stacks increase skips)
- Overload: +25% self-dmg taken next turn (additive; Storm risk)
- Echo: Repeat last applied effect next turn (non-stacking; copies potency)

Sustain:
- Regen: Heal X/turn (additive; ticks at EOT)

CASCADE ACTIONS – DETAILED LOGIC
- Chain: Must match current element. Effect × mult → +1 pt.
- Dual (Chain variant): Match → normal Chain. Optional: Spend exactly 2 pts → swap to fixed new element + bonus burst/utility.
- Transmute: Spend X≥3 pts + Energy. Burst ×X → refund Y pts in chosen element. Good pair → +50% burst & +1 pt refund.
- Shift: Spend 1–2 pts + low/no Energy. Mini-burst × spent + flavor + refund 1–3 in chosen.
- Finisher: 0–3 Energy + consume all current pts (≥4 req). Match = full ×pts; mismatch = half. Reset to 0 Neutral.

ENEMY & FIGHT DESIGN
- Scaling: Normal ~50 HP, Elite ~120, Boss 200+ (phases at 50%/25%).
- Intents: 2-turn preview icons + text (e.g., "20 dmg + Poison 2", "Gain Strength 3", "Drain 3 Cascade pts if ≥L4").
- AI Priorities: Target lowest Block first. Echo mechanic: Last player element → apply minor version.
- Special: Some elites/bosses "Punish bank" (extra dmg if Cascade ≥5).

RUN & META PROGRESSION
- Dungeons: Themed, finite (25–35 nodes).
- Node Breakdown: ~60% fights, 20% shops, 15% rests/events, 5% elites.
- Map: Branching web, 3 Acts, bosses every ~10 nodes.
- Permadeath: Lose 30% gold + run-only cards.
- Rewards: Normal/Elite fights: Gold ~15 + single-run relics + chance to heal/upgrade a deck card (for the run). Boss fights: Packs (pick 1 of 3 cards) + above.
- Persistent: Deck (12→50+). Deck Limits: Max 4 copies non-Legendary; max 1 copy Legendary.
- Heroes: 4 starters (e.g., Swapper: Transmutes 0E). Shared gold, unique packs/relics.
- Shop (Meta Hub, outside dungeons): Spend gold on packs (many types/contents), Elemental Pack 150g, Transmute Pack 200g, Relic Slot 250g, +1 Energy 400g, Thin deck 75g, etc.
- Legendary Cards: Unlocked via achievements, story progression, milestones (e.g., clear 10 dungeons). Not in packs/shops.
- Milestones: Clear X dungeons → new packs/heroes/Legendaries. Prestige: Reset for multipliers.

BALANCE & EDGE CASES
- No decay: Enables long banks → counter with enemy drains, cap 7, high-L risks.
- Multi-element viability: Duals/Shifts ~30–40% cards → target 20–30% winrate boost for hybrids.
- Edge: L0 Neutral → only neutral cards/Shift to start. Finisher mismatch at L7 still strong bailout. Exhaust thins deck dynamically.
- UI must show: Exact previews (e.g., "Finisher: 6 pts Fire match → 72 dmg" / "Mismatch → 36").